<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine weekly grain/oilseed export snapshot.</title>
<headline>Argentine weekly grain/oilseed export snapshot.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Agriculture Secretariat weekly estimate, to February 5 of 1995/96 shipments (1996/97 wheat, sunflower seed), 1996/97 export commitments (1995/96 sorghum, soybeans) and purchases by exporters in indicated crop years (thousands of tonnes).</p>
<p> ...........shipments..commits..crop year...exporter purchases</p>
<p> .............................................1995/96..1996/97</p>
<p> Bread wheat  4,691.4  7,900.0   Dec-Nov	    n/a  6,900.8</p>
<p> Maize	  6,988.6  2,700.0   Mar-Feb	6,766.8  1,572.2</p>
<p> Sorghum	  665.7    670.0   Mar-Feb	  634.5     35.4</p>
<p> Soybeans     2,011.8  2,100.0   Apr-Mar	2,073.3    847.2</p>
<p> Sunseeds	   0.0    600.0   Jan-Dec	    n/a     24.7</p>
<p>((-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541-318-0655))</p>
